# Build and tools

Details: `docs/engineering/cmake-python.md`. Contract: TZ §2.3–2.7.

```cmake
# BAD
file(GLOB_RECURSE SRC src/*.cpp)
include_directories(src)

# GOOD
target_sources(sim_core PRIVATE src/sim/application/step.cpp)
```

CMake: target-scoped options; explicit sources; pinned FetchContent in `cmake/Dependencies.cmake`; GoogleTest **test-only**; warnings not inherited by third-party.

Python: `.venv` + ruff; `pathlib`; `subprocess.run([argv], timeout=..., cwd=...)`; one `tools/play.py`; never `shell=True` or `pkill godot`.

Don't: fetch deps during `ctest`/`play.py`; custom `gtest` `main` plus `gtest_main`; Playwright.
